      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Castelo de Areia. Palossand arrasta Pokémon menores para dentro de seu corpo arenoso e drena sua energia vital quando deseja. Pelas cavidades dos braços, dispara os ossos ressecados das vítimas.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 11 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 8 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Amorfo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 2/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Palossand é a evolução final de Sandygast.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Absorb, Astonish, Harden, Sand Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Sand Tomb</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Mega Drain</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Bulldoze</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Hypnosis</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Iron Defense</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Giga Drain</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Shadow Ball</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Earth Power</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Sandstorm, Shore Up</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>After You, Amnesia, Attract, Block, Body Slam, Brine, Bulldoze, Chilling Water, Confide, Confuse Ray, Curse, Double Team, Earth Power, Earthquake, Embargo, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, Flash Cannon, Fling, Frustration, Giga Drain, Giga Impact, Gravity, Hex, Hidden Power, Hyper Beam, Imprison, Infestation, Iron Defense, Mud Shot, Mud-Slap, Night Shade, Pain Split, Poltergeist, Protect, Psychic, Quash, Rain Dance, Recycle, Rest, Return, Rock Polish, Rock Slide, Rock Tomb, Role Play, Round, Sand Tomb, Sandstorm, Scary Face, Scorching Sands, Shadow Ball, Skill Swap, Sleep Talk, Sludge Bomb, Snore, Spite, Stealth Rock, Stone Edge, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Tera Blast, Terrain Pulse, Toxic, Trick</p>",
